/target
/.worktrees
__pycache__/
# bstack's host hooks and sensors write state into any .control/ they find (the L3 edit log,
# the leverage sensor). The two governance files the workspace policy names under .control/ stay
# trackable without `git add -f` (BRO-3702).
/.control/*
!/.control/rcs-parameters.toml
!/.control/policy.yaml
